/// Whether a supervised child is running, being restarted by OTP, or stopped
/// with its spec still held (terminated, not yet restarted or deleted).
type SupervisorChildStatus = #running | #restarting | #stopped

/// SupervisorChild — one child spec of a running `Supervisor`, as reported by
/// `Supervisor>>whichChildren` (BT-3966).
///
/// A point-in-time value: the runtime mints one per child spec from OTP's
/// `supervisor:which_children/1`. A running child carries its live object
/// (an Actor, or a Supervisor/DynamicSupervisor handle); a child that OTP is
/// restarting, or that was terminated but whose spec is still held, has
/// `child` nil and a `status` of `#restarting` or `#stopped`. Ask the
/// supervisor again to observe change.
///
/// ## Examples
/// ```beamtalk
/// info := app whichChildren first
/// info id            // => #listener
/// info status        // => #running
/// info isRunning     // => true
/// info child         // => the running Listener
/// info childClass    // => Listener
/// info type          // => #worker
/// ```
///
/// @see Supervisor (whichChildren, childWithId:, terminateChild:, restartChild:)
sealed typed Value subclass: SupervisorChild
  /// The OTP child id: the class name by default, or the `withId:` value
  /// (a Symbol or an Integer).
  field: id :: Symbol | Integer = #unknown
  /// The running child (an Actor or a Supervisor/DynamicSupervisor handle),
  /// or nil when `status` is not `#running`.
  field: child :: Object | Nil = nil
  /// `#running`, `#restarting` or `#stopped`.
  field: status :: SupervisorChildStatus = #stopped
  /// `#worker` or `#supervisor` (the OTP child type).
  field: type :: Symbol = #worker
  /// The child's Beamtalk class, or nil if its module is not a Beamtalk class.
  field: childClass :: Class | Nil = nil

  /// Whether the child is running (`status` is `#running`).
  ///
  /// ## Examples
  /// ```beamtalk
  /// info isRunning   // => true
  /// ```
  isRunning -> Boolean => self status == #running

  /// Whether the child is a supervisor (`type` is `#supervisor`).
  ///
  /// ## Examples
  /// ```beamtalk
  /// info isSupervisor   // => false
  /// ```
  isSupervisor -> Boolean => self type == #supervisor
